346	     * Rejects a create whose city already contains {@link #CITY_CAPACITY} or more owners, so no city
347	     * ever exceeds its capacity. Cities are compared case-insensitively with surrounding whitespace
348	     * trimmed. The count reflects the
349	     * state before the new owner is persisted, so it excludes the owner being created.
350	     *
351	     * @param city the city of the owner being created
352	     * @throws CityAtCapacityException if the city already contains {@link #CITY_CAPACITY} owners
